Description: Gh0st OS system configuration
 Configuration only: apt sources and pins, what dpkg leaves out, which
 services start, journald off, zram, sysctl, udev rules for the Raspberry Pi
 devices, NetworkManager privacy defaults, and the one-time migrations
 the update engine runs.
 .
 libspa-0.2-bluetooth is PipeWire's Bluetooth audio, which our WirePlumber
 config turns on. It is here so it is in place before the postinst
 restarts WirePlumber.
